 Screenshot 4.png", "id": "873992396602223", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_873992399935556_1633622422788963725_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YMW1rrGh4acQ7kNvwHCiL0q&_nc_oc=Adr0Z6724Ye2VSszoYX-jTxK9-RIKLEUbtokbTitXWJczpe0917WkeZXiZynP6GWnis&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af50tBcL8KMQ3W-4A6It9syC-u4jWDw8NcxC7Wap9Yxsnw&oe=6A1B05FE"}, {"file_name": "EEC Screenshot 5.png", "id": "5395686713791034", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974748_5395686717124367_6902466276144487558_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SBB-yoVpnCgQ7kNvwFx2nzB&_nc_oc=Ado_wRTCgqGLIjXc7z1oxpdZmBtncvQV7lQ9YjS9kCcUgAZjilXEI3kynm9J_p-rJ6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4HraS6xfCIaDwapK2ckC21pXMvSlLFcrfdeLuLZ3KqZg&oe=6A1B0446"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ellic's Exercise Class", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!", "short_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!"}]}, "developer_